ta-counter-list-9-reset="0">If the main() is provided with arguments : 1.34, 1.98 then the program should print the output as:</p><p data-ref="10013282-bece-4071-a8d8-d60fb037dd10" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Area of square for side in meters 1.34 : 1.7956</p><p data-ref="7d38753a-da39-4bd3-879b-bc2f8a2a031d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Area of rectangle for length and breadth in meters 1.34, 1.98 : 2.6532001</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="38e017ce-46c1-4e39-a93e-d0fbcdb8faea"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="72a53389-a3b9-4a5a-91c0-3c3efdb21065"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="140a8c70-0e8a-4080-a789-55ff79a623bd" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="d26d6723-544e-4e0a-b055-2aaecdd899be" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="53b1f020-0629-4139-b34f-b2a374fddf65" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">OverloadArea.java</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="50576ddb-eba7-4bab-ba14-d476ed72b912" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">class OverloadArea{
	void square(float side){
		float result= side*side;
		System.out.printf("Area of square for side in meters %.2f: %.4f%n",side,result);
	}
	void rectangle(float length,float breadth){
