fd14037e" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="afd18a5b-5897-4646-aef7-94e7499fd868" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="8daa876c-62bf-435c-abc2-4e9d25dee24f"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="1b44ef4b-8f98-40e0-acc5-ff71f099dbee"><p data-ref="23a759b3-d027-4026-b40f-1e22aae3297d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program to show multilevel inheritance to manage student information and calculate their marks. The program should include the following functionalities:</p><p data-ref="aac63f1a-b001-46bc-92c9-abd3df242a6f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="2d099e31-8ff1-4c5c-9cde-728e1167c732">Student Class:</strong></p><p data-ref="54d581c8-1f5c-4608-83aa-507880c8a924" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This class should contain two attributes:</p><ul data-ref="f16c79be-053c-48ba-af77-c493dfec1491" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="e346610c-51e3-435a-af4a-e384a5dca447"><strong data-ref="ef7d4f2e-6836-4200-a86a-a30aee473a0d">id (int)</strong>: Represents the student's ID.</li><li data-ref="4f8e9e08-1a72-41ea-8a13-6cc5da50803f"><strong data-ref="7c11284c-d9a8-4673-b84f-7362a6f35439">name (String):</strong> Represents the student's name.</li></ul><p data-ref="5141e235-6d8a-4c12-8c60-2c2ddc15fb0d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Methods:</p><ul data-ref="21acb714-9c64-4c52-aa70-67d55886b8f2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="c96e6800-709f-4919-ac79-021970b51fc6"><strong data-ref="ea4dd230-d1b6-43de-8cb7-e1d5a27e1386">setData(int id, String name): </strong>To set the student's ID and name.</li><li data-ref="fd56035b-d252-4dc9-aeec-2f10dd2d0296"><strong data-ref="9bfa8d26-ca8a-4ecf-9119-79132a815c81">displayData():</strong> To display the student's ID and name.</li></ul><p data-ref="cd06a617-d3f0-48e4-9759-5d7cb64f331a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0"