om:1px solid black;" data-ref="0f79e856-e73e-4ef9-a065-a14360179bb7" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="d97347e2-2e05-4591-acba-785ad6146012"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="35160594-893e-4f6e-ab02-75f546099d8b"><p data-ref="d3a81888-59ac-4aad-9b68-571b64b9d50e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Design an abstract class named <strong data-ref="396dae44-532c-4b35-91de-e7518b8a1bfd">Shape</strong> to represent geometric shapes. The <strong data-ref="84cacbe6-28db-46e6-8de0-4e4fe2005bf1">Shape</strong> class should declare the following abstract methods:</p><ul data-ref="de250ea9-636e-4a37-a025-5364cfab3497" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="f7be7741-5fa5-4e78-b19d-c3c6874739b8"><strong data-ref="19f2effe-e7e4-4e40-824b-bc7a7da02da5">double calculateArea(</strong>): Calculates and returns the area of the shape.</li><li data-ref="215a79d5-9167-4d62-97f8-8d5c2c7b6e58"><strong data-ref="dd4e8e61-76f9-4710-b1a4-96a11f76cbe1">double calculatePerimeter()</strong>: Calculates and returns the perimeter of the shape.</li></ul><p data-ref="56b907db-fd8f-4e2c-9c8d-ce84cdb93863" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">In addition, implement a concrete method named <strong data-ref="010750a2-98eb-4b32-96a1-4a3aafd62633">displayDetails()</strong> that displays the area and perimeter of the shape. Create a subclass named <strong data-ref="3595081b-0391-4bc1-9e7c-eefaf8979642">Circle</strong> that extends the <strong data-ref="f851608b-f101-46a4-8cdc-40b0cf21e9c7">Shape</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="4d9ddd2e-a11f-434a-a3cc-41c7b8fab7d3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="f28189b5-a352-4457-bebf-aee8ed8fec6d"></p><p data-ref="aaaefe27-1d80-4b23-95b6-b65fa6df2263" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="2dc08215-99c1-48f2-a79f-afac1f1f5894">Circle</strong> class should:</p><ul data-ref="88fbafaf-5aa5-45e5-ab73-b740f9c28d5f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="e8346a4a-7818-4732-a194-08973efbed46">Store the radius of the circle.</li><li data-ref="097c866e-1330-415a-846c-16400790bc9d