style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="46290a85-e48b-4c6b-91e0-584baf17a376" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="6d673afa-fc76-42cd-b8d7-a8e914360e8f"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="b66fa1b8-788a-4c1c-bdda-b308d25951c5"><p data-ref="aea71bb9-aeaa-49db-923e-fb8c9d66a01c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">You are required to implement the <strong data-ref="5bafa8fc-3706-4402-a779-e59066c58ba5">Circle</strong> class, which demonstrates multiple inheritance using interfaces. The provided <strong data-ref="7a08a9f3-ac34-45f1-8671-62658f06737f">Shape</strong> and <strong data-ref="e7bd2d7d-d9d9-4867-a53d-6cdc57f19932">Color</strong> interfaces define methods that need to be implemented within the <strong data-ref="660bdc3e-572d-4ce5-ae81-5d107c3a4c5d">Circle</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="ae0a58cf-67a4-442a-b1ef-f0e4dbe78fd6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="4ff24266-da3f-453b-b505-1a565aa81be6"></p><p data-ref="a8d9c97a-0acf-4571-83be-ee8b61e7f79e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. <strong data-ref="66336368-28af-47cc-a356-f026c4c071dc">Shape</strong> Interface:</p><p data-ref="63300594-c40a-49ce-b32e-ca1bf45e5e83" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="9a692a0f-4ef9-4748-bfc4-9855862e4a62">Shape</strong> Interface contains two methods:</p><ul data-ref="4d097a0a-fc65-4d27-adcb-97ca8952301c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="3292917e-71c1-44c5-bcd8-4d4c024ebb50"><strong data-ref="35512abd-4bb5-47af-a61a-7063a53c12ba">double calculateArea():</strong> To calculate the area of the circle.</li><li data-ref="b49840c4-372d-4d39-8df3-0e6065381a16"><strong data-ref="29123e27-b9f6-4c66-8fc8-e27efab86a6c">double calculatePerimeter():</strong> To calculate the perimeter of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="48aeffcb-c23f-4da5-8d54-c6818ae376c1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="81c1cb4e-a265-4a2d-9584-72cb7aa55028">Color</strong> Interface contains one method:</p><ul data-ref="00dd328b-0dee-4b65-a741-9c6d87cb8f58" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data