der-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="367b40e3-04a6-48b9-9c90-31e4ccce6d4c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="20304ae7-bacb-45f0-a404-ca942ea53f89"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="55d33079-6ee8-4ac7-98f6-3626333603f1"><p data-ref="7143500f-eed9-4ade-868b-75e84dbfe6cc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program that creates two threads, <strong data-ref="78cc4e0f-5590-4116-80ba-d6cb3940e45b">FirstThread</strong> and <strong data-ref="b77372d1-c413-4f07-a1d4-3522db5035a4">SecondThread</strong>, to print messages a specified number of times with a 100 ms delay.</p><ul data-ref="612a8b82-e88e-4186-85a6-59a909fd974b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="8a305b2b-c7d6-4eff-9fe0-5121bfab098c">The program should prompt the user to enter the number of messages for the First Thread and the Second Thread.</li><li data-ref="343b362d-9b2d-4515-8d52-14bc25e65066"><strong data-ref="fabad49a-3d05-4e4a-921c-3e7f20925d7d">FirstThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from First Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="799aa89b-2b11-4860-81ef-f6fcbaf4c53f"><strong data-ref="fcb47e54-b96c-465d-b75f-0362b5629f2b">SecondThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from Second Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="8090c537-ce15-4944-b387-8a3fce1eee24">The main thread should:</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="a9f6b643-5422-4e4f-aa91-972effdab3bd">Start both threads using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="d00afb52-6375-4fb8-9061-ed8512edcf67">start()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="45eb4d34-c277-4c4a-abc3-52ebf87fbe8d">Display their alive status using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="64a4e86e-6a58-4577-aa3d-75db13bf1e89">isAlive()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="88690e08-8cca-4d22-ada7-8109ac25ca26">Wait for each thread to finish using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="fa0d5ee0-3a87-42d2-96bd-f5be76223e77">join()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="3cbb3ccd-9379-46c5-9f96-cd3e3766052a">Display messages while waiting and after completion.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="d1db3c94-5fcd-4244-aa66-2c3c8df6e6df">Verify and display the alive status of threads after they complete.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="5e3ddb47-aefd-4ce5-adcd-ef3788ebf18a">Print a final message indicating the main thread has finished.</li><li data-ref="2c08591e-0397-4f74-afd8-6c989293b05c">Both threads should properly handle <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="63f0fd19-ecd8-4e3d-8818-245c9f88ef70">InterruptedException</span> during sleep.</li></ul><p data-ref="0d365015-99a4-4e90-a4fc-0d0321670f96" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="44f83e55-cd3c-4000-ad06-9f5c8acbf4b3"></p><p data-ref="65657e41-5811-4ebe-9c21-8686471816c6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" da